        <mxCell id="step-1-legend" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="legend-container" connectable="0"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="520" height="90" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-1-badge-legend" value="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-1-legend"><mxGeometry x="0" y="2" width="40" height="38" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-1-desc-legend" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Build once, no AWS access&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;A push to main starts deploy.yml. The build job builds an OCI archive once, gates it with Trivy and records SBOM and provenance attestations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=light-dark(#000000,#FFFFFF);fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-1-legend"><mxGeometry x="52" y="0" width="468" height="90" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-2-legend" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="legend-container" connectable="0"><mxGeometry x="0" y="96" width="520" height="90" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-2-badge-legend" value="2" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-2-legend"><mxGeometry x="0" y="2" width="40" height="38" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-2-desc-legend" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Production approval&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;The deploy job waits for the production environment reviewer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=light-dark(#000000,#FFFFFF);fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-2-legend"><mxGeometry x="52" y="0" width="468" height="90" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-3-legend" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="legend-container" connectable="0"><mxGeometry x="0" y="192" width="520" height="90" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-3-badge-legend" value="3" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-3-legend"><mxGeometry x="0" y="2" width="40" height="38" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-3-desc-legend" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Request a JWT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;The job asks the GitHub OIDC provider for a token with aud sts.amazonaws.com and sub repo:OWNER/REPO:environment:production.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=light-dark(#000000,#FFFFFF);fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-3-legend"><mxGeometry x="52" y="0" width="468" height="90" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-4-legend" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="legend-container" connectable="0"><mxGeometry x="0" y="288" width="520" height="90" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-4-badge-legend" value="4" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-4-legend"><mxGeometry x="0" y="2" width="40" height="38" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-4-desc-legend" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Exchange it for credentials&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity: STS checks the deploy role trust policy against the IAM OIDC provider and returns 1-hour credentials.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=light-dark(#000000,#FFFFFF);fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-4-legend"><mxGeometry x="52" y="0" width="468" height="90" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-5-legend" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="legend-container" connectable="0"><mxGeometry x="0" y="384" width="520" height="90" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-5-badge-legend" value="5" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-5-legend"><mxGeometry x="0" y="2" width="40" height="38" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-5-desc-legend" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Push the scanned archive&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;skopeo pushes the archive to ECR with its digest preserved, checks the pushed digest and verifies the attestation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=light-dark(#000000,#FFFFFF);fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-5-legend"><mxGeometry x="52" y="0" width="468" height="90" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-6-legend" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="legend-container" connectable="0"><mxGeometry x="0" y="480" width="520" height="90" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-6-badge-legend" value="6" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-6-legend"><mxGeometry x="0" y="2" width="40" height="38" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-6-desc-legend" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Deploy by digest&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;Registers a task definition with image@sha256 and updates the ECS service; the circuit breaker rolls back a failed rollout.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=light-dark(#000000,#FFFFFF);fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-6-legend"><mxGeometry x="52" y="0" width="468" height="90" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-7-legend" value="" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="legend-container" connectable="0"><mxGeometry x="0" y="576" width="520" height="90" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-7-badge-legend" value="7" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-7-legend"><mxGeometry x="0" y="2" width="40" height="38" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-7-desc-legend" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Verify the rollout&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;scripts/verify-deployment.sh checks the PRIMARY revision, rollout COMPLETED and healthy tasks on the digest.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=light-dark(#000000,#FFFFFF);fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="step-7-legend"><mxGeometry x="52" y="0" width="468" height="90" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend-line-styles" value="&lt;b&gt;Line styles&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=light-dark(#F5F5F5,#29393B);strokeColor=#666666;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;fontSize=14;fontColor=light-dark(#232F3E,#E6E6E6);fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="legend-container"><mxGeometry x="0" y="678" width="520" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
